[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800100_04_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800100_04_0010","text":"（……哦，这里也有卖的。买点回去──）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800100_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800100_04_0020","text":"好好吃啊！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800100_04_0030","text":"我的也～\n朝日酱分你一口～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800100_04_0040","text":"谢谢！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800100_04_0050","text":"不客气～！\n哈——，得把所有口味都尝一遍才行……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800100_04_0060","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800100_04_0070","text":"…………呵呵，才没有"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800100_04_0080","text":"（为了她们现在冬优忍一忍什么的，\n　或者一起吃比较好什么的，才没有）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800100_04_0090","text":"（明天买去当慰问品什么的，才没有没有）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800100_04_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800100_04_0100","text":"──冬优自己最优先"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31800100_04_0002","text":"Motion"}]
